#: ../../../projectconf/sections/platformio/options/generic/default_envs.rst:19
msgid ""
"The :ref:`cmd_run` command processes all environments ``[env:***]`` by "
"default if the :option:`pio run --environment` option is not specified. :ref:"
"`projectconf_pio_default_envs` allows one to define which environments that "
"should be processed by default."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../projectconf/sections/platformio/options/generic/default_envs.rst:24
msgid ""
"Also, :ref:`piodebug` checks this option when looking for debug environment."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../projectconf/sections/platformio/options/generic/default_envs.rst:26
msgid ""
"This option can also be configured by the global environment variable :"
"envvar:`PLATFORMIO_DEFAULT_ENVS`."
msgstr ""

